  <Properties>
    <Name>JFD's Civilizations - Papal States for VP</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]The Papal States[ENDCOLOR] under Julius II for Vox Populi.</Teaser>
    <Description>[ICON_BULLET]Trait: The Apostolic See
			[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UB: Chapel (Temple)
			[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UU1: Disciple (Standalone)
			[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UNW: Vatican Museums (Hermitage)
			[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UU2: Swiss Guard (Standalone)</Description>
    <Authors>JFD, Janboruta, HungryForFood, Jarcast</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>whoward69</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
